// The PTODSL reproducer retains the issue's EmitC entry and independent VPTO
// Cube/Vector children. Each child starts at pipe_init instance zero. Their
// generated wrapper names must survive ordinary linking without collision.
// The harness resolves peer FIFO configuration before compiling the children
// separately, then links neutral LLVM fixtures using their actual bridge names.
// No CANN, device or host JIT is needed.
// RUN: bash "%S/Inputs/check_bridge_symbol_namespace.sh" "%S/Inputs/issue_1760_ptodsl.py" "%t" %python "pto-test-opt" llvm-link ptodsl
